   "text": "2024"
  },
  {
   "level": 3,
   "html": "Keeping AI Honest",
   "text": "Keeping AI Honest"
  },
  {
   "level": 3,
   "html": "Creating a Shared Visual Language",
   "text": "Creating a Shared Visual Language"
  },
  {
   "level": 3,
   "html": "<span>“</span><span>It was a challenge to find a cohesive visual language that can speak to quite complex processes and products. Using lilac as the overarching brand color allowed us to use stronger accent colors to create differentiation whilst keeping things cohesive.</span><span>”</span>",
   "text": "“It was a challenge to find a cohesive visual language that can speak to quite complex processes and products. Using lilac as the overarching brand color allowed us to use stronger accent colors to create differentiation whilst keeping things cohesive.”"
  },
  {
   "level": 4,
   "html": "Michael Cannon",
   "text": "Michael Cannon"
  },
  {
   "level": 5,
   "html": "Art Director",
   "text": "Art Director"
  },
  {
   "level": 3,
   "html": "Powering Understanding Through Animations",
   "text": "Powering Understanding Through Animations"
  },
  {
   "level": 3,
   "html": "<span>“</span><span>The timing of the animations and text coming in gives the site a sense of dynamism without taking away from the content.</span><span>”</span>",
   "text": "“The timing of the animations and text coming in gives the site a sense of dynamism without taking away from the content.”"
  },
  {
   "level": 4,
   "html": "Joris Rotteveel",
   "text": "Joris Rotteveel"
  },
  {
   "level": 5,
   "html": "Senior Developer",
   "text": "Senior Developer"
  },
  {
   "level": 3,
   "html": "Tools for the Future",
   "text": "Tools for the Future"
  },
  {
   "level": 3,
   "html": "<span>“</span><span style=\"color:#1D1C1D\">Gladeye joined us at each step of a two-year journey to shape our product and positioning. They were steadfast and enthusiastic as our technology became significantly more advanced —and complex. Their impact was undeniable and indispensable.</span><span>”</span>",
   "text": "“Gladeye joined us at each step of a two-year journey to shape our product and positioning. They were steadfast and enthusiastic as our technology became significantly more advanced —and complex. Their impact was undeniable and indispensable.”"
