   "text": "MenuEQTY Lab WebsiteTrust in Machines: How EQTY Lab Brings Integrity to AIVisit SiteBuilding trust in AI by turning complexity into clarity"
  },
  {
   "html": "</path></svg></span></span></a></div></h4></div><div class=\"col-span-full space-y-1.5 md:col-span-4\"><h3 class=\"t-p font-semibold\">Category</h3><h4>Brand + Website</h4></div><div class=\"col-span-full space-y-1.5 md:col-span-4\"><h3 class=\"t-p font-semibold\">Date</h3><h4>2024</h4></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-theme=\"light\" class=\"text-theme-secondary transition-colors duration-theme\"><div class=\"WrokBloks_main__IqYqU\"><div class=\"ui-grid mx-auto my-xl-20 max-w-site gap-y-6 md:my-xl-40\"><div class=\"col-span-full lg:col-span-7 xl:col-span-12\"><h3 class=\"t-p-md font-medium\">",
   "text": "CategoryBrand + WebsiteDate2024Keeping AI HonestAI is shaping the future. But without proper guidance, it can go off track — causing more harm than good. That’s why EQTY Lab is committed to ensuring AI systems are transparent, secure, and trustworthy. Their mission? To build a future where AI operates with integrity and is used for the greater good. To achieve this, EQTY Lab is creating a powerful suite of AI governance tools and products."
  },
  {
   "html": "<span>EQTY Lab needed a brand and website that could simplify their complex ideas and offerings — one that would connect with anyone, not just tech experts. The challenge was heightened by the need to represent multiple product offerings within the same digital experience.</span>",
   "text": "EQTY Lab needed a brand and website that could simplify their complex ideas and offerings — one that would connect with anyone, not just tech experts. The challenge was heightened by the need to represent multiple product offerings within the same digital experience."
  },
  {
   "html": "<br/><span>Our designers developed a color, stylistic, and iconographic system that represents the different tools under the EQTY Lab umbrella while maintaining visual cohesion. This ensured that when users switch between products, the visual language feels consistent and clear. The signature lilac color sets the tone, with bold accent colors defining each product area. Custom icons simplify complex ideas, turning abstract concepts into easy-to-understand visuals.</span>",
   "text": "Our designers developed a color, stylistic, and iconographic system that represents the different tools under the EQTY Lab umbrella while maintaining visual cohesion. This ensured that when users switch between products, the visual language feels consistent and clear. The signature lilac color sets the tone, with bold accent colors defining each product area. Custom icons simplify complex ideas, turning abstract concepts into easy-to-understand visuals."
  },
  {
   "html": "<span>Animations on the site are where the magic happens! We developed a custom-built animation system that triggers animations at precise moments as users scroll. This precision creates the feeling that users are interacting with the systems driving the website in real time.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span>But the animations are more than just eye candy. They guide visitors through EQTY Lab’s story, simplifying complex product flows and making the site feel cohesive and connected. Our custom-built animation system ensures content appears with perfect timing, creating a smooth ",
   "text": "Animations on the site are where the magic happens! We developed a custom-built animation system that triggers animations at precise moments as users scroll. This precision creates the feeling that users are interacting with the systems driving the website in real time.But the animations are more than just eye candy. They guide visitors through EQTY Lab’s story, simplifying complex product flows and making the site feel cohesive and connected. Our custom-built animation system ensures content ap"
  },
  {
   "html": "<span>The website’s technical foundation ensures it’s as functional as it is beautiful. We used Next.js to keep the site fast and responsive. Storyblok powers the content management system, giving EQTY Lab’s team full control to manage and expand content as their products evolve.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span>Storyblok’s flexible component system allows each element to have multiple options and variants, enabling the EQTY Lab team to tailor content with precision and flexibility.</span><span><br/></span><span><br/></span><span>We used Framer Motion to bring animations to life",
   "text": "The website’s technical foundation ensures it’s as functional as it is beautiful. We used Next.js to keep the site fast and responsive. Storyblok powers the content management system, giving EQTY Lab’s team full control to manage and expand content as their products evolve.Storyblok’s flexible component system allows each element to have multiple options and variants, enabling the EQTY Lab team to tailor content with precision and flexibility.We used Framer Motion to bring animations to life — a"
  },
